<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Johana Laica</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f5f8ff;
      --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      --text: #213a63;
      --muted: #6a7997;
      --primary: #4f77df;
      --primary-2: #7898ff;
      --border: #dbe7ff;
      --shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(56, 82, 145, 0.14);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, #dce8ff, transparent 24%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, #eef1ff, transparent 26%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #f9fbff, #edf3ff);
    }

    .topbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 16px 28px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(54, 90, 170, 0.08);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #23416d;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-2));
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: white;
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(79, 119, 223, 0.4);
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #34507e;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: 0.25s ease;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      background: #edf3ff;
      color: var(--primary);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .layout {
      max-width: 1220px;
      margin: 32px auto;
      padding: 0 20px 30px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .sidebar,
    .content {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .sidebar {
      padding: 24px;
      height: fit-content;
    }

    .profile-photo {
      width: 168px;
      height: 168px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 18px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 5px solid #dce8ff;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(48, 75, 138, 0.25);
    }

    .profile-name {
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.18rem;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .profile-role {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .units-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .units-list li {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f9ff, #edf3ff);
      border: 1px solid #dce7ff;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 13px 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #36507e;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 34px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #23406c;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    }

    .summary-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .card {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f9fbff, #edf4ff);
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid #dce7ff;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .label {
      display: block;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: #7084a7;
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .value {
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #27446f;
    }

    .bibliography {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff, #eef4ff);
      border: 1px solid #d7e4ff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 22px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #334a74;
    }

    .bibliography-title {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #e9f0ff;
      color: #35548f;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .topbar { flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
      .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .content { padding: 22px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">JL</div>
      <span>Johana Laica</span>
    </div>

    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="#">Inicio</a>
      <a href="#">Unidad 1</a>
      <a href="#">Unidad 2</a>
      <a href="#">Unidad 3</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="layout">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <img
        class="profile-photo"
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
        alt="Foto de perfil"
      />

      <div class="profile-name">Johana Laica</div>
      <div class="profile-role">Estudiante de Ingeniería en Software</div>

      <ul class="units-list">
        <li>Unidad 1</li>
        <li>Unidad 2</li>
        <li>Unidad 3</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>

    <section class="content">
      <h1>Johana Laica</h1>

      <div class="summary-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="label">Edad</span>
          <span class="value">20 años</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="label">Ciudad</span>
          <span class="value">Salcedo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="label">Pasatiempo</span>
          <span class="value">Fútbol</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="label">Carrera</span>
          <span class="value">Ingeniería en Software</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bibliography">
        <div class="bibliography-title">Bibliografía</div>
        <div>
          Tengo 20 años, soy de la ciudad de Salcedo. Me gusta jugar fútbol y ahora estoy
          estudiando una carrera de Ingeniería en Software.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
